✔ created [ROOT]/snapshotted (all platforms; default: web)
  next: cd [ROOT]/snapshotted && leptoskit build
  then: leptoskit db migration create init
  then: leptoskit doctor checks every tool your platforms build with
working with a coding agent? give it leptoskit's skill: leptoskit skill install
before starting the server, store AUTH_ENCRYPTION_KEYS with Monosecret: monosecret set AUTH_ENCRYPTION_KEYS --provider keyring "$(date +%Y-%m):$(openssl rand 32 | basenc --base64url | tr -d =)"
